  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusion through Data, Impact and Statistics (INCLUDIS) (Global) 2026-2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INCLUDIS is a portfolio investment of Gender Equality, Disability and Social Inclusion focused data and statistical programming. INCLUDIS has global coverage, with a focus on the Asia-Pacific region. INCLUDIS contains principal gender and disability programs designed to holistically support the full data value chain, with activities including capacity building, technical support, methodological and standards development, and enabling environment strengthening.</narrative>
  </description>
